repository-code: https://github.com/mdmasrurhr/diamond-strain-pinn
abstract: >-
  Code and data for predicting the bandgap of strained diamond from the
  six-component Green-Lagrange strain tensor. The dataset holds 1,292
  deformation states computed with hybrid-functional DFT. The models combine
  a neural network with deformation-potential and Bir-Pikus models of the band
  edges; the repository includes every training run of the paper as a task
  list, the calibration of the analytic models, the baselines, and the
  analysis that produces every number, table and figure.
keywords:
  - physics-informed neural network
  - diamond
  - bandgap
  - strain engineering
  - density functional theory
  - deformation potential
